{"id":"8c35cc87b3063540","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-oracle-enumeration.md","title":"Oracle Enumeration Lemma","display":"lem-oracle-enumeration — Oracle Enumeration Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-oracle-enumeration","aliases":["88-lem-oracle-enumeration"],"display":"lem-oracle-enumeration — Oracle Enumeration Lemma","depends_on":["[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","[[88-df-ce-indexing]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-oracle-enumeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-oracle-enumeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-oracle-enumeration — Oracle Enumeration Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"63bffa02095213d3\" href=\"?note=63bffa02095213d3\" title=\"88-df-ce-indexing\">88-df-ce-indexing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e,B_{e,s},\\rho,\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}\">\\(F_e,B_{e,s},\\rho,\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e,W_{e,s}\">\\(W_e,W_{e,s}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"63bffa02095213d3\" href=\"?note=63bffa02095213d3\" title=\"88-df-ce-indexing\">88-df-ce-indexing</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in V\">\\(F\\in V\\)</span> 是候选规则集。每条规则的神谕条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是有限二进制词，不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 本身有限；规则集的类型、相容单值性及扩张闭包由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}\\)</span> 限定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F_e),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall F\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)\\to\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;F=F_e\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{CE}\\left(\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(e,\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)):\ne\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F_e\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F_e),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall F\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)\\to\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;F=F_e\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{CE}\\left(\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(e,\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)):\ne\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F_e\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对阶段及阶段内的扫描次序归纳，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{e,s}\">\\(B_{e,s}\\)</span> 有限、递增，而且任意两条相容规则在同一输入上有相同输出。扩张规则的相容性会蕴含原条件的相容性，故向上闭包仍单值。轮流执行有限阶段并枚举各已接纳条件的有限扩张，得到最后一行的一致枚举，因而每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e\">\\(F_e\\)</span> 满足全部合法性条件。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 本身合法，选取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 恰为其规则数码集。该索引下所有候选规则两两相容时输出一致，没有规则会被拒绝；每条规则最终被扫描并接纳。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 已对初段扩张封闭，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e=F\">\\(F_e=F\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>执行这些规则的操作含义是：在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 上枚举规则，遇到相应条件后只查询其有限定义域中的神谕位；发现匹配规则就输出。反之，普通确定性神谕机的每次有限收敛运行产生一条规则，且其所有神谕初段扩张产生相同输出。因此该枚举确实覆盖神谕可计算部分函数，而不只是一个任意命名的规则子族。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-oracle-rules","status":"resolved","id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-indexing","status":"resolved","id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-indexing]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-rules","status":"resolved","id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F_e,B_{e,s},\\rho,\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-indexing","status":"resolved","id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W_e,W_{e,s}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-set]]；$\\mathrm{enc}$ 见 [[88-df-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W_e,W_{e,s}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-set]]；$\\mathrm{enc}$ 见 [[88-df-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W_e,W_{e,s}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-set]]；$\\mathrm{enc}$ 见 [[88-df-encoding]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F_e,B_{e,s},\\rho,\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}","display":false},{"tex":"W_e,W_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F_e),\\\\\n&\\forall F\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)\\to\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;F=F_e\\bigr),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{CE}\\left(\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(e,\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)):\ne\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F_e\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"F_e","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F_e=F","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":2239,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F_e,B_{e,s}$ 与 $\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]；枚举的单值性见 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"不能先列出全部 c.e. 规则集，再通过一个不可判定的全局合法性测试筛掉坏索引。本构造直接把**每个**自然数 $e$ 有效变成一个合法功能规则图；枚举的正确性、满性和一致可枚举性由 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]] 给出。"},{"id":"47142c2c72e0fb46","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]] 保证每个 $F_e$ 合法、枚举一致有效且覆盖所有合法规则图。"},{"id":"c24d037bf910fb4b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F_e,\\rho$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]；其一致有效枚举及满性见 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"3d14d294ed1b6514","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F_e$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]，合法规则图的实现见 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-195","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness.md]]\n[[88-lem-countable-syntax.md]]\n[[88-lem-finite-injury-verification.md]]\n[[88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence.md]]\n[[88-lem-numeral-functional-representation.md]]\n[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration.md]]\n[[88-lem-oracle-parameterization.md]]\n[[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b80082f9a69a6b62","63bffa02095213d3","b283fc95a9b1376d","3b05ff7db230d81f"]}